        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Vision of the Future, Thrawn trilogy, Survivor's Quest\n- People: Timothy Zahn\n- Concepts: Hand of Thrawn novels, Heir to the Empire trilogy, Star Wars novels\n\nFacts:\n- The Thrawn trilogy, also known as the Heir to the Empire trilogy, is a best-selling science fiction novel series written by Timothy Zahn.\n- Vision of the Future is a 1998 Star Wars novel by Timothy Zahn.\n- Vision of the Future is the second of the two Hand of Thrawn novels.\n- The two Hand of Thrawn novels follow Timothy Zahn's Thrawn trilogy.\n- Survivor's Quest was written by Timothy Zahn.\n- Survivor's Quest is a sequel to Timothy Zahn's 1998 Star Wars novel Vision of the Future.",
